{
  "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
  "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "voice_key": "xiaoxiao",
  "files": [
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-1",
      "filename": "intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.37,
      "size": 53856,
      "text": "拿一个甜甜圈，在它表面画一条封闭曲线。规则是：一边绕着中心孔转，一边绕着管子转。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-2",
      "filename": "intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.09,
      "size": 49392,
      "text": "绕中心孔的圈数记作 q，绕管子的圈数记作 p。这两个整数一定，曲线就完全定了。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "intro",
      "line_id": "intro-3",
      "filename": "intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/intro-intro-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.45,
      "size": 55152,
      "text": "把这条曲线从环面上取下来，套上一层圆管，就得到一个实心的纽结。这类纽结叫环面纽结。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wh-1",
      "filename": "why-wh-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/why-wh-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.88,
      "size": 46080,
      "text": "纽结理论有个现实困难：给定一个纽结，算它的不变量往往很麻烦，得靠查表。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wh-2",
      "filename": "why-wh-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/why-wh-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.33,
      "size": 53280,
      "text": "环面纽结是难得的例外。它的主要不变量都有现成的公式，只需要 p 和 q 两个数字代进去。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "why",
      "line_id": "wh-3",
      "filename": "why-wh-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/why-wh-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.29,
      "size": 52560,
      "text": "所以它成了纽结理论最好的教材：所有量都算得出来，不用背表，还能验证公式之间的一致性。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "formulas",
      "line_id": "fm-1",
      "filename": "formulas-fm-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/formulas-fm-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.9,
      "size": 62352,
      "text": "第一个是交叉数，等于 p 乘 q 减一与 q 乘 p 减一这两个数里的较小者。三叶结代入得三，五叶结得五。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "formulas",
      "line_id": "fm-2",
      "filename": "formulas-fm-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/formulas-fm-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.1,
      "size": 49536,
      "text": "第二个是亏格，等于 p 减一乘 q 减一再除以二。这是纽结的 Seifert 曲面上有几个洞。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "formulas",
      "line_id": "fm-3",
      "filename": "formulas-fm-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/formulas-fm-3.mp3",
      "duration": 2.91,
      "size": 46512,
      "text": "第三个是桥数，就是 p 和 q 中较小的那个。它表示纽结最少能分成几段上跨。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "gcd",
      "line_id": "gc-1",
      "filename": "gcd-gc-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/gcd-gc-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.58,
      "size": 57312,
      "text": "但有个前提必须先满足。绕行时如果 p 和 q 有公因数，曲线会提前闭合，绕不完整个环面。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "gcd",
      "line_id": "gc-2",
      "filename": "gcd-gc-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/gcd-gc-2.mp3",
      "duration": 4.09,
      "size": 65520,
      "text": "这时得到的不是一根绳子打结，而是好几根绳子套在一起，叫链环。分支的数量恰好等于 p 与 q 的最大公约数。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "gcd",
      "line_id": "gc-3",
      "filename": "gcd-gc-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/gcd-gc-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.57,
      "size": 57168,
      "text": "请切换到二和六，你会看到最大公约数是二，画面上出现两个分开的圈。三个公式此时都不适用。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "symmetry",
      "line_id": "sy-1",
      "filename": "symmetry-sy-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/symmetry-sy-1.mp3",
      "duration": 3.67,
      "size": 58752,
      "text": "现在做个实验：先看二和三，再看三和二。虽然绕行方式完全不同，得到的却是同一个纽结类型。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "symmetry",
      "line_id": "sy-2",
      "filename": "symmetry-sy-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/symmetry-sy-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.79,
      "size": 60624,
      "text": "这不是巧合。你可以验证三个公式在交换 p 与 q 后值都不变，交叉数、亏格、桥数一个都没动。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "symmetry",
      "line_id": "sy-3",
      "filename": "symmetry-sy-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/symmetry-sy-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.45,
      "size": 55152,
      "text": "几何上的解释是：把环面从内向外翻过来，经线和纬线的角色就互换了，而纽结类型不受影响。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-1",
      "filename": "summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-1.mp3",
      "duration": 2.89,
      "size": 46224,
      "text": "第一，环面纽结由两个整数 p 与 q 完全决定，绕经线 p 圈、绕纬线 q 圈。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-2",
      "filename": "summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-2.mp3",
      "duration": 3.05,
      "size": 48816,
      "text": "第二，交叉数、亏格、桥数都有现成公式，代入 p 与 q 即可算出，无需查表。"
    },
    {
      "script_id": "torus-knot-surface",
      "section_id": "summary",
      "line_id": "sum-3",
      "filename": "summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "path": "audio/narrations/torus-knot-surface/xiaoxiao/summary-sum-3.mp3",
      "duration": 3.92,
      "size": 62640,
      "text": "第三，p 与 q 必须互素才是纽结，否则是链环，分支数等于最大公约数。感谢观看，我们下次再见。"
    }
  ],
